                                          "date":  "2026-11-14",
                                          "title":  "Multiplayer Open Beta has concluded",
                                          "notes":  "Thank you guys for playing! Over 3500 unique players logged on to try the beta! I\u0027ve got a lot of balance changes to make and missing features to add, but multiplayer will return!\n\nJoin the Discord for more details, and to fill out the multiplayer feedback form!\nhttps://discord.gg/MTKwud2cCP"
